From a2a887c3c513ff32999f0991aee1e620c1198f01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 11:44:17 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Gluon ledger hardening and site<->server transfer queue

- CurrencyLedger: concurrent requests with the same idempotency key return the stored entry
  instead of failing (unique index race), so each operation id applies exactly once.
- New currency_server_operations queue (pending/applied/failed) with AzLink pull/ack API
  GET /api/azlink/coins/operations and POST /api/azlink/coins/operations/{id}/ack.
  Every balance change goes through the append-only ledger with op:{id}:* keys.
- Feature flag setting currency.server_queue_enabled (default 0): endpoints return 404 when off.
- Artisan: currency:verify-ledger (read-only), currency:queue-transfer (admin/test).
